-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Open-Core & Prebuilt Client Distribution Notice
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Open-Source Components (MIT Licensed):
   - DSH plugin server & bridge (`packages/dsh-plugin-jphone/lib/`, `locale/`, `tests/`)
   - Built-in Mini-App templates, protocol specifications, and documentation (`docs/`)
   - Official AI co-creation Skills (`skills/`)
   - Decentralized Workshop index, schema, and example packages (`workshop/`)

2. Prebuilt Client Binaries & Brand Assets:
   - Compiled Flutter Web bundle (`packages/dsh-plugin-jphone/web-dist/`) and
     prebuilt Android APK packages distributed via GitHub Releases are provided
     free of charge for personal and non-commercial use with DeepSeek Harness.
   - The native mobile client source code and optional hosted cloud services
     are maintained separately and are not covered by the MIT grant above.
   - Brand names ("小鲸同学", "JingChan") and official character illustrations
     remain the property of their respective authors.
